# Host-level redirects, read by Workers static assets. The build moves this
# file to the top of dist/ (scripts/hoist-host-files.js). Rules apply top to
# bottom, first match wins, and they apply even where a file exists, so
# static rules come first and nothing below may match a /docs path.

# Redirects within the docs, which are served under /docs

